        "A permissive cleanup leaf can produce misleading DAG-run outcomes if it becomes the only relevant terminal success. Airflow 3.1.0 documentation explicitly warns about leaf nodes and trigger rules. Separate cleanup from a terminal business validation gate that depends on required committed outputs. A branch join should accept intentional skips only under a rule appropriate to that branch design."
