        "The fixture makes the business gate an explicit Boolean over required success and cleanup success. It demonstrates why cleanup alone is insufficient without claiming that this Boolean function is Airflow trigger-rule code. Real integration tests should cover success, required upstream failure, deliberate branch skip and cleanup failure."
